ent": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}], "questions": [{"responses": [{"selected": 0, "id": 0, "correct": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, {"selected": 0, "id": 1, "correct": 1, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}]}], "stimuli_ids": [], "id": 10, "template_override": 1}, {"type": "DWS", "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " \nFind out about domestic cleaning services.\n", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Take Away", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Writing", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Speaking", "type": "skill"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "\nInstructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self Assessment.\n", "type": "text"}]}], "questions": [{"responses": [{"selected": 0, "id": 0, "correct": 1, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "engenn9le07ob04re7pdf01.pdf", "type": "pdf"}]}]}], "stimuli_ids": [], "id": 11, "template_override": 1}], "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"id": 0, "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}]}, {"_data": [], "type": "audio", "title": "", "template_override": 1, "id": 1, "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"text": "", "image": "engenn9le07ob04re2img05.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally:</span> Hey Vanessa! What happened to you? You look so down today.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa:</span> Yeah, I am pretty stressed out. My parents are coming to visit. Because my work schedule is so busy, I haven't had the chance to clean. My mom is a bit of a neat freak. She'll be very disappointed in me. You understand why I'm upset, don't you?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Sally:</span> Hmmm.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa:</span> The windows and floor need to be washed. The carpets need vacuuming. The kitchen and bathroom need a good scrub! The garbage needs to be taken out ...\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Sally:</span> Don't worry. We can get your place cleaned up. They're coming next week, aren't they?", "image": "engenn9le07ob04re2img05.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa:</span> No, they aren't. They are coming in two days! I'm working long shifts today and tomorrow. I'll have no time to clean! This is a big problem, isn't it?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Sally:</span> No, it's not. I am sure we can find a solution.  You've tried calling the cleaning companies already, haven't you?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa:</span> No, I haven't. We don't have cleaning companies here in Cambridge, do we?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Sally:</span> Yes, we do. I call them all the time. You can too! I can call today if you can't. I'm not working today like you are.", "image": "engenn9le07ob04re2img05.jpg", "time": "36200", "id": 2}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa:</span> Thanks Sally you're phenomenal!\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Sally:</span> They have great rates. I can make sure everything is washed, tidied, dusted, and put away while you work. You stop worrying.  I'll take care of it. I'm a great organizer!\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa:</span> You are the best Sally! I'll leave it to you!\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Sally:</span> I get to help you out for a change!", "image": "engenn9le07ob04re2img05.jpg", "time": "69000", "id": 3}], "coverimg": "engenn9le07ob04re2img05.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn9le07ob04re2aud01"}, "type": "slideshow"}]}]}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Sharing the Housework", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "House Cleaning Nightmare", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 4, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 7, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B2.1", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": " Describe ways of solving problems and getting things done in social contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Integrates a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge when dealing with problems and difficulties. ", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Placeholder", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": " Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear. ", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Integrates a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge when dealing with problems and difficulties. ", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear. ", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": " Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear. ", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Integrates a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge when dealing with problems and difficulties. ", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": " Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear. ", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn9le07ob04re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " Intonation of Short Questions, Statements and Question Tags", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " Intonation is the rise and fall of your voice when you speak. You use intonation to convey meaning. It is the speaker's choice.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": " In short statements, you use falling intonation to signal that you are finished what you are saying. <br /><span class=\"italic\">No, they aren't.</span> <br /><br /> In short questions, the intonation patterns are: <br /><br /> <span class=\"strong\">Yes/No Question </span>= Rising Intonation<br /> <span class=\"italic\">Do you like cleaning the house? </span> <br /><br /> <span class=\"strong\">WH/Information Question</span> = Falling Intonation<br /> <span class=\"italic\">What happened to you?</span> <br /><br />  In <span class=\"strong\">Tag Questions </span>(short questions at the end of statements) = Rising or Falling Intonation. You use <span class=\"strong\">falling intonation</span> (your voice goes down) to signal that you believe what you said is correct.  You use <span class=\"strong\">rising intonation </span>(your voice goes up) when you are checking, because you are not sure if you are correct. These two sentences are the same, but they have slightly different meanings as they are said differently, depending on the speaker's intention.  <br /><span class=\"italic\">You understand why I'm upset, don't you? <br /> <span class=\"italic\">They're coming next week, aren't they? <br /><br />  Practice reading the dialogue out loud. Concentrate on the correct intonation of the questions as you read it.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " Stressing <span class=\"italic\">You</span> and <span class=\"italic\">I</span>", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You stress <span class=\"strong italic\">you</span> and <span class=\"strong italic\">I</span> to add meaning and emphasis to a statement.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "When you stress a word, you make it longer, louder and a little higher tone. You can put stress on a word to emphasize it and make your meaning clearer. <br/> You stress <span class=\"strong italic\">you</span> or <span class=\"strong italic\">I</span> when you want to emphasize something about a person that is not expected.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "For example: <br/> <span class=\"italic\">I'm okay.  What happened to <span class=\"strong\">you</span>?</span> <ul><li>When you put stress on <span class=\"strong\">you</span>, you shift the emphasis to the other person.</li> ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read these sentences with stress on the bolded words.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\"><ul><li><span class=\"italic\"> <span class=\"strong\">I</span>  call them all the time. <span class=\"strong\">You</span>  can too! <span class=\"strong\">I</span>  can call today if <span class=\"strong\">you</span>  can't. <span class=\"strong\">I'm</span> not working today like you <span class=\"strong\">are</span>.</span> </li> <li><span class=\"strong\">You</span>  stop worrying.  <span class=\"strong\">I'll</span>  take care of it. <span class=\"strong\">I'm</span>  a great organizer!</li> <li> <span class=\"strong\">I</span>  get to help <span class=\"strong\">you</span>  out for a change!</li> <li><span class=\"strong\">You</span>  are the best Sally! <span class=\"strong\">I'll</span>  leave it to <span class=\"strong\">you</span>!</li> </span> ", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to vacuum", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to clean with a vacuum cleaner ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The carpets need vacuuming.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le07ob04aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": " These are words you use to talk about getting your house cleaned.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "garbage ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "trash", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The garbage needs to be taken out .", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le07ob04aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "solution ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the process of solving a problem ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I am sure we can find a solution. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le07ob04aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "rate ", "type": "name"}, {"content": " tax or price", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:They have great rates. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le07ob04aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to scrub", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to use friction to clean hard with a brush", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The kitchen and bathroom need a good scrub! ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le07ob04aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "phenomenal ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "wonderful or extraordinary", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Thanks Sally you're phenomenal! ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le07ob04aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to tidy", "type": "name"}, {"content": " to clean ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I can make sure everything is washed, tidied, dusted, and put away while you work.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le07ob04aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Find out what types of cleaning services are available in your country.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Find out where they are, what they do and how much they cost.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Take notes and write your findings up in a paragraph.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Bring your paragraph to class and read it to a partner.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Listen to your partner's findings.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Discuss what you have found, comparing the services.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I find out about domestic cleaning services.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write up a paragraph on my findings.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I share and discuss my findings with a partner.", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "sena"}